        <p style="padding: 0 20px 20px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--body)"><span data-l="en">This coast sits in the rain shadow of the mountains, so it gets far less rainfall than the south of Bali. Mornings are calmer than afternoons whatever the month.</span><span data-l="id">Pesisir ini berada di balik pegunungan sehingga curah hujannya jauh lebih rendah daripada Bali selatan. Pagi lebih tenang daripada sore, bulan apa pun.</span></p>
